## Step 2: Frontend — Granular Context Architecture

Goal: Each context subscribes to one WS channel, placed deep in the component
tree so only relevant subtrees rerender. Livestream model — smooth, reactive,
no full-page update cascades.

1. Create context layers depending on uses like webhooks.
2. Create reusable hooks based off the specification.
3. Create reusable components by decomping them in stages, easy medium hard. Start with easy and provide brief context on medium, hard.
4. Plan css module pattern.

Contexts: AgentContext, TaskContext, PipelineContext, FeedContext, StatsContext,
ChatContext, RoutingContext. Full spec in plan file.

